flowchart TD
    Start([Budget Officer Receives Proposal]) --> CheckStatus{Is Proposal<br/>Approved?}
    
    CheckStatus -->|No - Officer Approved Status| Reject["❌ Reject Submission<br/>Status must be Officer Approved"]
    Reject --> End1([Process Ends])
    
    CheckStatus -->|Yes| Decision{Submission Type}
    
    Decision -->|Single Proposal| SingleSubmit["📤 Submit Single Proposal<br/>to Budget Manager<br/><br/>Function: officerSubmitToManager"]
    Decision -->|Multiple Proposals| MultiSubmit["📦 Consolidate Multiple<br/>Proposals First<br/><br/>Function: consolidateProposals"]
    
    SingleSubmit --> UpdateSingle["Update Proposal Data:<br/>✓ status = Forwarded to Manager<br/>✓ workflowLevel = MANAGER<br/>✓ submittedToManagerAt<br/>✓ submittedToManagerBy<br/>✓ Record in workflowHistory"]
    
    MultiSubmit --> CreateConsolidated["Create Consolidated Proposal:<br/>✓ New parent proposal<br/>✓ Link original proposals<br/>✓ Set isConsolidated = true<br/>✓ consolidatedOrigin = Office Name"]
    
    CreateConsolidated --> UpdateOriginals["Update Original Proposals:<br/>✓ Mark as consolidated<br/>✓ Set submittedToManagerAt<br/>✓ Set submittedToManagerBy<br/>✓ Update status to Forwarded to Manager"]
    
    UpdateOriginals --> UpdateEntities["Sync All Related Collections:<br/>✓ PersonnelServices<br/>✓ MooeProposal<br/>✓ CapitalOutlay<br/>✓ Income Collection<br/>✓ Update status and metadata"]
    
    UpdateSingle --> CheckBRD{Will Reach BRD<br/>Analyst Level?}
    UpdateEntities --> CheckBRD
    
    CheckBRD -->|Yes| CreateBRDRecord["🏢 Create BRD Consolidation Record<br/><br/>Function: createConsolidationRecord<br/><br/>Trigger: FORWARDED_TO_BRD_ANALYST"]
    CheckBRD -->|No| SendNotif
    
    CreateBRDRecord --> GeneratePath["Generate Consolidation Path:<br/>Regional: Region/Division<br/>Central Office: Central Office/Department<br/><br/>Store in consolidationPath field"]
    
    GeneratePath --> StoreBRD["Store BRD Record Data:<br/>✓ proposalId<br/>✓ region, division, department<br/>✓ consolidationPath<br/>✓ isCentralOffice flag<br/>✓ Proposal snapshot"]
    
    StoreBRD --> SendNotif["📬 Send Notifications<br/>to Budget Manager<br/><br/>Message: Consolidated Proposal<br/>Submitted for Final Approval"]
    
    SendNotif --> Return["✅ Return Response<br/>with Updated Proposal<br/>for Real-time UI Update"]
    
    Return --> End2([Submission Complete])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End1 fill:#ffe1e1
    style End2 fill:#e1f5e1
    style SingleSubmit fill:#fff4e1
    style MultiSubmit fill:#fff4e1
    style UpdateSingle fill:#e1e5ff
    style CreateConsolidated fill:#e1e5ff
    style UpdateOriginals fill:#e1e5ff
    style UpdateEntities fill:#e1e5ff
    style CreateBRDRecord fill:#f0e1ff
    style GeneratePath fill:#f0e1ff
    style StoreBRD fill:#f0e1ff
    style SendNotif fill:#e1f0ff
    style Return fill:#e1f0ff
    style Reject fill:#ffcccc